## Domain modules (`modules/{entity}/`)

Pure Java — **no JPA, no Quarkus imports**.

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `{Entity}Status.java` | Enum stored as `String` in DB |
| `{Entity}Draft.java` | Immutable normalized input record |
| `{Entity}Rules.java` | `normalize()`, `validate()` — all business invariants |

Services call `Rules.normalize()` then `Rules.validate()` before persist. Throw `{Entity}ValidationException` for 400 responses.

Register module in root `pom.xml` and add `plm-module-{entity}` dependency to `apps/api/quarkus/pom.xml`.

